wa-bridge-mcp
=============

This project is a derivative work based on "whatsapp-mcp" by Luke Harries:

    https://github.com/lharries/whatsapp-mcp
    MIT License — Copyright (c) 2025 Luke Harries  (see LICENSE)

Substantial modifications in this fork:
  - Removed the bundled Go WhatsApp bridge and all direct SQLite access.
  - The Python MCP server now talks exclusively to a separately-hosted WhatsApp
    bridge over its HTTP REST API (/v1/*) — see whatsapp.py.
  - Configuration via WHATSAPP_BRIDGE_URL + WHATSAPP_BRIDGE_TOKEN; defaults to
    the hosted bridge at https://api.api-supp.com/v1.

